2 CONT Peder Ivarhus Rasmussen Linga [3760] 1660 - 1727 BIRTH: 1660, (Galtung) Strandebarm, HO (kalt 'Preste-Per') DEATH: 1727 EVENT: 25 Jul 1676, Ble student. Skulle stud. til prest, men fullf. ikke studiet Father: Rasmus Pedersen  Moth
2 CONC er: Magdalene Christine Lauritzdatter Galtung 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : Margrethe Eliasdatter Skånevik MARRIAGE: 1688, (senere skilt) DIVORCE: 1702, (etter at Peder skal ha rømt med "et løst Quindfolk")
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2 : Siri Larsdatter  Family 3 : Inga Farteindatter
2 CONT  Johannes Pedersen Family 4 : Herborg Hallsteinsdatter Rødi MARRIAGE: ABT 1711 +Rasmus Pederson Linga
