2 CONT https://www.newspapers.com/article/the-record-obituary-for-elna-j-balchen/49599313/
2 CONT
2 CONT Elna J Balchen - Teaneck
2 CONT Funeral services will be tomorrow at 10 a.m. at Our Saviour's Lutheran Church for Elna J. Balchen of 887 Prince St, who died at the Bergen County Courthouse in Hackensack on Thursday after a heart attack. Burial will be in Flower 
2 CONC Hill Cemetery, North Bergen.
2 CONT Mrs. Balchen, 62, was taken ill while serving on jury duty and died in a third floor restroom a short time later.
2 CONT Mrs. Balchen was born in Hoboken and had lived here 30 years. She was a member of the Hackensack and Englewood Yacht Clubs.
2 CONT She is survived by her husband, Thomas A Balchen, a son, Thomas P of Matawan, two sisters; Margot and Ellen Markstrom of Cliffside Park,
2 CONT two brothers; Arnt Markstrom of Cliffside Park and Louis Markstrom of Palisides Park, and three grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/162408696/elna-johanne-balchen
