2 CONT ------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Margrethe Pedersdatter P Falchenberg
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 1664
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 1712                    at: Trondheim
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried: 22 Nov 1712     at: Vår Frue kirke, Trondheim
2 CONT
